"Software") for Magento 2. It is a legal agreement between you, an individual or a legal
entity (the "Licensee"), and eBusiness360 – Maxime LESGUILLIER aka Maxcode (the "Licensor").
By purchasing, installing or using the Software, the Licensee acknowledges having read this
agreement and accepts its terms. If the Licensee does not accept them, the Software must not
be installed or used.

1. GRANT OF LICENSE
   In consideration of the lawful acquisition of the Software:
   a) The Licensee receives the complete source code of the Software.
   b) The license is valid for ONE (1) single Magento production installation and an unlimited
      number of related test, development and staging installations. A Magento installation in
      a multi-store setup (several storefronts or domains served by the same installation) is
      covered by a single license.
   c) The Licensee may adapt and customize the Software for its own needs on the licensed
      installation.
   d) Each additional Magento production installation requires the purchase of a separate
      license.

2. UPDATES AND SUPPORT
   a) The purchase of the Software includes twelve (12) months of updates and technical support
      from the date of purchase.
   b) After this period, the Licensee retains the right to use the acquired version of the
      Software perpetually, in accordance with section 1, but no longer benefits from updates or
      support.
   c) Renewal of updates and support for a further twelve (12) month period is offered at fifty
      percent (50%) of the price of the Software in effect on the renewal date.

3. RESTRICTIONS
   The Licensee shall not, in whole or in part, whether free of charge or for a fee:
   a) resell, distribute, publish, sublicense, rent, lease, lend, assign or make the Software
