   c) place the Software on a server allowing its distribution over a public network or the
      Internet for distribution purposes;
   d) remove, obscure or alter any proprietary, copyright or license notices, or this agreement.
   Any use not expressly authorized by this agreement is prohibited.

4. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY
   The Software remains the exclusive property of the Licensor and is protected by intellectual
